# Public exhibitor directories (company, booth, website) are safe to commit.
# Attendee / contact exports are personal data and must stay off the repo, the
# same rule the tec5 app follows. Ignore anything that looks like a people list;
# allow the public exhibitor CSVs through.
*attendee*
*attendees*
*contact*
*people*
*.jsonl
!*-exhibitors.csv
